          <div class="case-hero__grid">
            <div class="type-heading-lg case-hero__summary">
              <p>This year TDW had a truly magical atmosphere thanks to the workshop theme “Beauty and the Beast”, where the students had to focus on the opposites and their attraction. Each of them was randomly assigned a fairy tale to use as inspiration for a variable type concept to reflect the protagonist and antagonist of the story through the contrast between construction and deconstruction.</p>
            </div>
